          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مدونة (mudawwana) is built on the native Arabic root d-w-n (Lane), where dawwana is \"to write into a register\", a dīwān. Mudawwana is \"a thing written down\"; the blog is its modern sense."
            }
          ]
        },
