          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نفى (nafā) is built on the native Arabic root n-f-y (Lane), \"to drive away, to banish\". To deny a report is to drive it away."
            }
          ]
